        "body": "{\"result\":\"ok\",\"response\":\"entity\",\"data\":{\"id\":\"37816dc3-20a5-44b7-a889-b245b85e036d\",\"type\":\"manga\",\"attributes\":{\"title\":{\"ja-ro\":\"Ijimete Ijirarete\"},\"altTitles\":[{\"ja\":\"\\u30a4\\u30b8\\u3081\\u3066\\u30a4\\u30b8\\u3089\\u308c\\u3066\"},{\"en\":\"Bullying and Being Bullied\"},{\"es-la\":\"Acosando y Siendo Acosada\"},{\"es-la\":\"Acosadora y Acosada\"},{\"vi\":\"B\\u1eaft n\\u1ea1t v\\u00e0 b\\u1ecb b\\u1eaft n\\u1ea1t\"},{\"pt-br\":\"Bullynando e Sendo Bullynada\"}],\"description\":{\"en\":\"Himeri Shishido is a tough, popular delinquent girl with high confidence in her strength.\\nShe spends her days harassing Ui Odagiri, an otaku girl in her class, with the excuse of just \\u0022playing around\\u0022.\\nHowever, something unexpected will put them into a secret relationship!\\nMay it be Violence? Or maybe a Master \\u0026 Slave relationship? Anything can happen in this bullying love story!~\",\"es-la\":\"Himeri Shishido es una chica dura, popular y delincuente con mucha confianza en su fuerza Pasa sus dias acosando a Ui Odagiri, una chica otaku de su clase, con la excusa de simplemente \\u0022jugar con la tonta. Sin embargo, algo inesperado los pondr\\u00e1 en una relaci\\u00f3n secreta \\u00bfPodr\\u00eda ser violencia? \\u00bfquiz\\u00e1 una relaci\\u00f3n entre ama y esclavo? Cualquier cosa puede pasar en esta historia de amor de acoso\",\"pt-br\":\"Himeri Shishido \\u00e9 uma garota delinquente popular e durona, com muita confian\\u00e7a em sua for\\u00e7a. Ela passa os dias atormentando Ui Odagiri, uma garota otaku de sua classe, com a desculpa de estar apenas \\u0022brincando\\u0022. No entanto, algo inesperado as colocar\\u00e1 em um relacionamento secreto! Ser\\u00e1 viol\\u00eancia? Ou talvez uma rela\\u00e7\\u00e3o de mestre e escrava? Tudo pode acontecer nesta hist\\u00f3ria de amor com tem\\u00e1tica de bullying!\"},\"isLocked\":false,\"links\":{\"al\":\"215087\",\"kt\":\"ijimete-ijirarete\",\"mu\":\"